{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新華社報道，中國共產黨第二十屆中央委員會第五次全體會議，即中共二十屆五中全會上午在北京開始舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道指，中共中央總書記習近平代表中央政治局向全會作工作報告，並就《中共中央關於持之以恆推進全面從嚴治黨若干重大問題的決定（討論稿）》向全會作了說明。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:34.379521+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:41.978123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:31.750773+00:00","content_hash":"a944caa0aa6b1dc214d14a91b7f5a26d84ae3847fec10c5d3de33c416b55548c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}